      "id": "3d0829fdb69cbc02c9d568a2c69f54042b87b45cf12ab9a1dbfec8801af18ece",
      "title": "Misread Mandate",
      "url": "https://www.cjr.org/the_media_today/ice-terrorist-through-looking-glass-noem-trump-alex-pretti-ice-killing-murder-lies-contradictions-video-shooting.php",
      "category": "uncategorized",
