      "id": "a752fe907ccd2ee20316fc3c3f53b76fe739af886dd1545828217d37cc6af9eb",
      "title": "Misread Mandate",
      "url": "https://www.cjr.org/analysis/what-the-washington-post-cuts-will-do-layoffs-business-of-news-jeff-bezos.php",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T22:02:51.489Z",
