 is ceasing publication. It has been an extraordinary privilege. salon.com/2026/11/05/goo… 12:03 AM · Nov 6, 2026 · 2,649 Views 2 12 73 3 Urban Xavier @xavier_urban Nov 6 Crazy that the blue tsunami couldn’t save Salon. I guess the people voting for Socialists aren’t actually reading books or even articles. 2 44 cartwright @cartwright024 Nov 6 Actually, it's been forgotten by thinking people for decades. That's why it's going out of business. Turns out pandering to the craziest among us is not a sustainable business model. Although bigger than it should be, it's still a small group. 18",
